WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.560
A registration form. It looks finished.

2
00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:08.520
A screenshot would sign it off.

3
00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:11.490
Take the mouse away. Keyboard only.

4
00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:14.470
Press Tab. Where does focus go?

5
00:00:14.470 --> 00:00:20.470
Focus moves, but nothing shows it: outline none.

6
00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:30.980
The submit button is a div. Tab skips it. Enter and Space do nothing.

7
00:00:30.980 --> 00:00:39.240
Repair one: a native form and a native button.

8
00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:44.740
Focus-visible: a ring you can see.

9
00:00:44.740 --> 00:00:50.030
Repair two: persistent labels, connected with label for.

10
00:00:50.030 --> 00:00:55.330
Accessibility tree (simplified): every input has a name.

11
00:00:55.330 --> 00:01:00.810
Invalid data: errors linked with aria-describedby and aria-invalid.

12
00:01:00.810 --> 00:01:07.670
Values preserved. Focus moves once, to the first invalid field.

13
00:01:07.670 --> 00:01:15.310
Same journey, corrected form: Tab Tab Tab Enter Tab Tab Space.

14
00:01:15.310 --> 00:01:18.780
Accepted. Seven keystrokes, no mouse.

15
00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:25.190
A screenshot cannot show whether a form is operable.

16
00:01:25.190 --> 00:01:30.880
Keyboard test, not an audit. Announcements not verified.
